{:ev/id "lc-0016" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000015 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-blobs" :concept-id "m-blobs" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "Content-addressed blob store — the documents the KG is grounded in. Git never sees a blob: the log references {hash}; bytes live here. M0: the browser's origin-private file system (OPFS). Online: the org bucket under the same names — moving is a copy, no event changes. Every fn fails soft (nil) where OPFS is unavailable." :grounded-in "src-blobs"}}
