{:ev/id "lc-0027" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000026 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-fold" :concept-id "m-fold" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "The graph IS this fold: kg-state × event → kg-state, pure, cljc. S3/git stores events; this namespace is the whole 'database layer'. Projections (publishable?, stale set, closure) are further pure fns. Fold trusts accepted events — validation (schema, cycle check) happens at the door, before an event is appended, via `guard`." :grounded-in "src-fold"}}
