{:ev/id "lc-0033" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000032 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-guide" :concept-id "m-guide" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "The assistant in LEARNER mode, on the catalog (wiki/Assistant-Design, decided 2026-10-02: one assistant, living where you already are, mode by screen). It finds a course across every graph on the device and offers to start it; when nothing fits it says so plainly. Same engine as the author and tutor modes: the tool registry, the look-don't-touch loop, the token budget, one-tap action cards. Its own conversation — a learner's search is not an author's thread (decision #2)." :grounded-in "src-guide"}}
