{:ev/id "lc-0036" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000035 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-i18n" :concept-id "m-i18n" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "UI strings, kintale shape: ru first (the product's voice), de/en secondary. One dictionary, split across two files so the editor and the chat can be translated side by side: i18n_ui.cljs (:ui/…) and i18n_chat.cljs (:chat/…). The current locale is a reagent atom, so every `(t …)` in a render re-runs when it changes — no reload. Persisted under `loretile-locale`, the key the landing uses too, so one choice follows the visitor across both pages." :grounded-in "src-i18n"}}
