{:ev/id "lc-0048" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000047 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-learn" :concept-id "m-learn" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "The gap loop a learner walks (wiki/MVP.md) as a FEED — the surface the wiki settled on: the engine deals cards, narration wraps them, the composer is the tutor's door in learn mode and visibly locked in exams (Denis 2026-09-08: «chat-like UI where the user can ask after each step»). Modes are policy presets over one surface: diagnostic (no feedback, no composer) → plan → learn (feedback, tutor open, two-in-a-row check) → final (no feedback, locked) → result with debrief → round N+1. Attempts are an APPEND-ONLY LOG in localStorage; mastery is a projection over it. A RUN is one learning session: its feed, stage, round. Runs are kept the way the assistant's sittings are (session.cljs shape): the current one autosaves, «start over» shelves it, the palette reopens any past one." :grounded-in "src-learn"}}
