{:ev/id "lc-0081" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000080 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-tour" :concept-id "m-tour" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "First-time walkthroughs on driver.js (kintale.tour verbatim in shape): the MAP tour (controls + the legend — what colours and glyphs mean), the CHAT tour (fires with the first proposal cards), and the LEARN tour (fires on the first learning session — where the tutor lives, what is locked). Selectors are stable CSS classes, never localized titles. Flags are set the moment a tour STARTS — an abandoned tour counts as seen. Never throws: onboarding is a nice-to-have, not load-bearing." :grounded-in "src-tour"}}
