{:ev/id "lc-0090" :ev/ns "loretile-code" :ev/actor "build.py" :ev/ts 1792000000089 :ev/type :object-added :object {:id "o-m-vectors" :concept-id "m-vectors" :kind :explanation :level :apprentice :locale "en" :origin :authored :text "Concept vectors — a CACHE, never a fact: derived from title+definition, provider-specific, regenerable. Keyed by CONTENT HASH + embedding model — never by topic id: ids are unique inside a graph only, so two graphs with a `keys` topic used to overwrite each other and re-embed on every switch. An edited definition re-embeds lazily; a model switch drops all. Consumers: course intake candidates, intake-chat dedup, (later) the lake." :grounded-in "src-vectors"}}
